/*-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  1)  UNION the regular-season (“PITCH”) and post-season (“PITCH_POST”) pitch
      feeds that contain pitch–by–pitch data.
  2)  Keep only rows whose recorded pitch speed converts to a positive number.
